<title>SWITZERLAND: Engadiner Kraftwerke sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Engadiner Kraftwerke sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Swiss Bank Corp (SBC).</p>
<p>BORROWER - ENGADINER KRAFTWERKE AG</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - SBC	   AMT   =  100 MLN</p>
<p> CHF COUPON - 4.25	MATURITY - MAXIMUM TO 10.JAN.09*</p>
<p> TYPE  - DOMESTIC STR   PAY DATE   10.JAN.97</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  100.40	LISTING - SWISS STOCK EXCHANGE</p>
<p>*BOND CAN BE CALLED ON JAN.10.07 AND JAN.10.08. -- ZURICH EDITORIAL, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
